## 4.3 Intent detection

Alpha must distinguish:

- General conversation.
- Product questions.
- Pricing questions.
- Purchase intent.
- Sales enquiry.
- Quote request.
- Contact request.
- Human handoff request.
- Customer support request.
- Incomplete enquiry.
